OL,3,GNEWSAInquest shown moments leading up
OL,4,Ato man being shot
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest jury has been shown footage
OL,7,Fof the moments leading up to the death
OL,8,Fof a man who was shot seven times by
OL,9,Ftwo armed police officers.
OL,11,FSergii Kuzmenko, a Ukrainian who "spoke
OL,12,Flimited English", was killed by Cumbria
OL,13,FPolice officers responding to reports
OL,14,Fof a man making threats to kill while a
OL,15,Fyoung child was present.
OL,17,FIt happened at a house on Borland
OL,18,FAvenue in Carlisle on 19 December 2022
OL,19,Fand followed a 999 call from the man's
OL,20,Fsister.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
