OL,3,GNEWSAInquest shown moments leading up
OL,4,Ato man being shot
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior coroner Kirsty Gomersal reopened
OL,7,FKuzmenko's inquest and told the jury
OL,8,Fthere would be an examination of the
OL,9,Fuse of firearms and police policy for
OL,10,Finteracting with people whose first
OL,11,Flanguage is not English.
